    </content>    
    <glossary>
    <definition id="def-00001"><term>industry versus inferiority</term><meaning>Erikson’s fourth psychosocial stage of development, describing the way children construct their sense of success and accomplishment in work tasks, such as school</meaning></definition>
    <definition id="def-00002"><term>social competence</term><meaning>skill used to understand and respond to the differing expectations of various contexts and audiences</meaning></definition>
    </glossary>
  </document>